<Root>
  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major></Major>
    <Description>0 Recoil for THORNS UZK50GI 

SETUP
Right click the left mouse button and add the macro then set operating mode to use when held down 

WARNING
macro will not work if keyran drivers are not installed

GAME SETTINGS
Resolution-1920x1080
FOV-84
SenseHorizontal-13
SenseVertical-13
DPI-800

Made by Phibkool:)</Description>
    <Comment>https://keyran.net - Free macros download | Скачать бесплатные макросы </Comment>
    <GUIOption>
      <RepeatType>0</RepeatType>
    </GUIOption>
    <KeyUp>
      <Syntax></Syntax>
    </KeyUp>
    <KeyDown>
      <Syntax>LeftDown 1
Delay 15 ms
MoveR 0 13
Delay 15 ms
MoveR 0 13
LeftUp 1
Delay 15 ms</Syntax>
    </KeyDown>
    <Software>Tom Clancy's Rainbow Six Siege</Software>
  </DefaultMacro>
</Root>